{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16724","headline":"送唐大夫让节归山 · 于鹄","name":"送唐大夫让节归山","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"年老功成乞罢兵，玉阶匍匐进双旌。\n朱门鸳瓦爲仙观，白领狐裘出帝城。\n侍女休梳官样髻，蕃童新改道家名。\n到时浸发春泉里，犹梦红楼箫管声。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"于鹄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_16724.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16724","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}